{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106530","id":2526206135,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6Wkti3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106530","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106530.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106530.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106530","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106530/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106530/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106530/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/3295dcc7bf3bc28fb532b13804717a92dca87445","number":106530,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `HelperRect2D` as 2D-specific `ReferenceRect`","user":{"login":"Lazy-Rabbit-2001","id":22123964,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTIzOTY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22123964?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","html_url":"https://github.com/Lazy-Rabbit-2001","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lazy-Rabbit-2001/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12353\r\nAlso closes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9575 in another way\r\n\r\nSimply exposing `_edit_*` methods would bring with a lot of issues, so why not adding a node that achieves the similar way, with an interface exposed to users to customize their behavior of dragging the rect?\r\n\r\n## Why not using `ReferenceRect`, as the latter is also used in 2D space\r\nEven though it is, the new `HelperRect2D` is so light that it does take not so much space as `ReferenceRect`, and that users can easily customize their behavior by simply overriding `_rect_updated()`.\r\n\r\n## What are the advantages of `HelperRect2D`?\r\n\r\n- Lightness, as I've mentioned, this does not contain so many properties as `Control`-derived classes, i.e. the interface is neat and you will easily find the key properties of the node.\r\n- Pureness, as this only provides a frame. Without any script, you can clip the children with this node, unlike `Sprite2D` which requires you to have its `texture` given so as to drag the border.\r\n- Flexibility, as this is the nature of most of nodes in Godot. With a tool script, you can define your custom dragging behavior in the editor\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milesto